---
TDL: 0.1
Shell: 0.1
Name: Toggle
---

# A switch (Standard Modules > Toggle): a track and a thumb that slides. `Checked` is the state, set
# from outside (it moves the thumb and raises nothing); a click flips it and raises `On_Changed`
# once, with `event.old`, `event.new` and `event.value` (true or false). The user's flip stays until
# `Checked` is set to a different value. The look is the stylesheet's: the parts `::track` and
# `::thumb`, with `:checked`, `:hovered`, `:pressed` and `:disabled` (the thumb and the track ease
# over the theme's motion duration, and at once under reduced motion). The role is SWITCH with the
# state `checked`; give the call a `Label` to name it.
Module {
    Params {
        Checked { Type: boolean, Default: false }
        Label { Type: string, Default: "" }
    }
    Box {
        Name: Root
        Role: SWITCH
        Toggles: true
        Checked: {{ params.Checked }}
        Label: {{ params.Label }}
        Width: 40
        Height: 22
        Children {
            Rectangle {
                Name: Track
                Part: track
                Width: 100%
                Height: 100%
                Transition: [Fill, Border_Color]
            }
            Circle {
                Name: Thumb
                Part: thumb
                Diameter: 16
                Position: ABSOLUTE
                Left: 0
                Top: 0
                Transition: [Margin, Fill]
            }
        }
    }
}
